# Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill in the values you need.
#
# Secrets ONLY. Non-secret project defaults belong in `vstack.settings.toml`
# under [env] — that file is committed, this one is not.
#
# Precedence, lowest to highest: .env -> vstack.settings.toml -> .env.local,
# and a variable already exported in the parent shell beats all three. A stale
# export is therefore invisible until it fails: check with
# `.agents/skills/linear/scripts/linear.sh auth-check --strict`, whose
# `api_key_source` field reports which layer actually won.
#
# `skills/worktree` symlinks `.env.local` into worktrees, so these stay
# available in delegated sessions.

# Used by: linear (every live command and `sync`; cache reads work without it)
# Set to: a Linear personal API key (Settings -> Security & access -> API keys).
# The team it targets is LINEAR_TEAM in vstack.settings.toml, not here.
LINEAR_API_KEY=""

# Used by: deep-research / researcher agents.
# Set to: provider API keys for whichever research backends you enable.
PERPLEXITY_API_KEY=""
GEMINI_API_KEY=""
JINA_API_KEY=""
OPENAI_API_KEY=""
